  "observations": [
    "2019 registered same-location view shows charcoal window strips, brick corner, grey paved verge and branch along the side of the building. 2023 registered corroborates the main frontage and the turn geometry.",
    "On the 2025 aerial two different branch alignments can be read with the western main roadside. The off-map garage opening and later yard permissions remain unlocated.",
    "All levels are measured inside the parent game. Photographic position fields do not supply survey heights. No outside pixels are included.",
    "2023 near road mouth and 2019 inside the side lane both show the south-side branch descending away from the main street, with stepped street frontage, brick on the north and grey edge across the lane. Exact survey heights are unknown."
  ],
